adata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0d113-8e02-7280-b46e-2ebcc1ce632a"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"The ownership audit is pleasantly small:\n\n- **No standalone handoff document remains** in cledger or annals.\n- annals’ README/CLAUDE references are layer-boundary examples, not turnbridge implementation guidance; retain unchanged.\n- cledger `PRODUCT_INTENT.md` is an ordinary product-boundary document—explicitly excluded from blanket annotation—and contains no turnbridge implementation plan; retain unchanged.\n- cledger’s README has one duplicated turnbridge-owned item: encrypted-reasoning replay experiments/open questions. Turnbridge already owns the authoritative implementation and open-question text in `docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md`; cledger should retain only its storage contract and link there.\n- cledger’s `WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md` contains cledger-owned contracts, not turnbridge work, but its canonical-object section is stale (`ev1`, top-level actor/producer, `conversation`). Since this audit follows the migration, I’m correcting that section to the actual annals/cledger layering rather than leaving knowingly false design documentation.\n\nNo document qualifies for the generic cross-project warning sentence after removing the one duplicated passage; adding it elsewhere would be indiscriminate.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_023ca7b64172e9d2016ab4800a121487d2b5df2e980997b127","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1790214143.154962,"turn_id":"01a0d113-8e02-7280-b46e-2ebcc1ce632a"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_UxanAgBagDC9rRr5tv7ELsob","id":"ctc_023ca7b64172e9d2016ab4800e6de887d2ab1cd7043f8ac273","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n 'ev1-|conversation-ledger/v1|`conversation`|actor\\\\.id|producer\\\\.(source|model|provider|source_version|session_id)|identity subset|EvidenceEvent' docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md | head